    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Namicha, hayyu gudda lafa Meshekitifi ka Tubali, ka Gogu jed'ani, abaari waan jettuuni, Anini yayu siti nyaape, jed'iini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini kara d'ibi si qajeelche, fago lafa mirgaati siini d'ufe gaara Israelitini si baasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba guube tante d'ae, harka kanke bitaacha keesaa buuse t'iyale mirgicha keesaa si buusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siifi duula keetifi golini teetileeni ch'ufti gaareeni Israeli irati hobaatani, reefa keesani allaatiifi bineensi alaa nyaata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atini ballina lafaa keesati doota; nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lafa Magogutifi lafa afaani baariini jirtu, ta nami isii nagayaani taule, ibida iti kaye duuba akanaani nami ch'ufti aka anini AABBO Waaqa beekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba anini gumi tiyya ta Israeli, aka maqaani kiyya qulqullo garsiisa ammalle nami deebie maqa kiyya qulqullo int'ureesu. Duuba akasiini gochi ch'ufti aka anini AABBO Waaqa, qulqullo Israeli, beeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, Guyyaani anini ind'ufa jed'e kaani d'ufu male inhanqatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri dira Israeli keesa tau miha lola ka nyaapi iraa raawate kaani guure qoraani ibidaa tolfata. Worri wonteefi guubefi t'iyafi woraanafi boku ch'ufa guure ibidaani bobeese haga ganna torba qorani tolfata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri deebie raasa d'aqe qoraani inch'absatu, yokhaani badda d'aqe mukha inch'iru, wonti akanatiifi miha lola ka nyaapi iraa raawate kaani bobefatani. Worri nama duri worra saame balleese iti garagale saame balleesa. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Gogu awaalani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya wonti kunini ch'ufti taate, anini Gogu Bale Ideemtu, ta galaana soda ilaboru jirtu, lafa Israeli keesa fulla iti awaalani tolchaafi. Gogufi duula isaa ch'ufa achiti awaalani, duuba bale sunini Bale Duula Gogu jed'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli ch'ufti haga jia torba reefa suni wolti guure awaale, akasiini lafa qulqulleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami lafa suni keesa jiru ch'ufti wolti bahe worra kana awaala. Duuba guyya dabsacha tiyya worri sunileeni gurra argata. Nami waan kana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi jii torbaani kaani hobaele, nama tolchani, lafa suni ch'ufa keesa ergani, goblola hafe fa barbaada lafa qulqulleesa jed'aniini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri ato oli gadi maru yo lafe namaa argu, akheekha woi d'aatu lafe suni kaye, aka yo worri nama awaalu kaani d'ufu arge fuud'e Bale Duula Gogu jed'ani taani keesati awaalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(D'aatu suni dira maqa duula suni iti baasaniti jira.) Duuba akanaani lafti qulqulloofti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
