            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.17+REV.19.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mul 19.17-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan nani jed'e, Namicha, allaatiifi bineensa gosa ch'ufa yaami waan jettuuni, gara ch'ufaa wolti koota, sorio anini isanii kurfeese tana nyaad'a. Sorioni gaareeni Israeli irati tolchani tunini sorio guddo, ta isani fooni nyaattani d'iiga d'uddani quuftani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isani fooni askarti nyaattani, d'iiga worra lafa mohatu d'uddani — ka aka elemiyetifi aka ilmaani hoolatifi korbeeyiifi yokhaani koromi looni qaqalani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo anini worra kana ch'ufa aka sorio qaqale, allaatiifi bineensileeni, haga dandaani, gabbinna nyaatani quufani, d'iiga d'ugani woliini raraatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri fulla mesa sorio tiyya suniti, fooni fardatifi ka nama isa yabatutifi ka askarti aka heddule, haga dandae nyaate quufa. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worra Israeli lafa isaaniiti deebisani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'e, Anini gosa ch'ufa guddinna kiyyafi humna tiyya, ta waan d'ugaatifi ta qajeelumatini tolchu, garsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worri Israeli arti achi, aka anini AABBO, Waaqa isaani beekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle gochiti d'ibileeni, aka worri Israeli maro ch'ubbu worri nati hojateefi boojiani, beeti. Anini worra iraa garagale, harka nyaapa worraa, ka woraanaani worra fit'eti kenna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini maro ch'ubbu worraatifi t'uri hamtu worri tolche jed'e, waan worraa male kenneefi dudda iti gale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, Ammo amma tana anini d'aloota Yakobo, ka gumi Israeliti nahe worra horsiise deebanse, maqa kiyya qulqulloole jabeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja worri nagayaani worra ufi keesa tau, ka nami tokoleeni worra imudamsimne, worri aka gaafa duri nati garagale kaani ch'eera irati hafe, inded'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gumi tiyya ta boojiani lafa heddu geesani galche, akasiini gosa heddu aka anini qulqullo garsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba gumiini tiyya aka anini AABBO Waaqa isaani taanaani beeti. Wonti worri waan suni beekhufi, waan anini aka worra boojiani lafa d'ibi geesani iti lakise, ammo amma worra ch'ufa, ka tokole inhambisini, wolti guure lafa isaniti galchefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini lubbu tiyya worra Israeliti erga, armaa achi deebie dudda iti ingalu. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
